  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.32 “Maximum total trihalomethane potential (MTTP)” means “maximum total trihalomethane potential” as defined in 40 CFR §141.2, as reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
